Subject: [PATCH 3/8] T71 F3: the wall twice, the front view and the internal
 layout

setElevation: the engine's fronts with the project's shaker frame, handles where
drilled, the design layer's worktop, wall ends and ceiling, appliance spaces named by
TYPE (D/W behind, FRIDGE behind) on the front view; fronts off on the internal layout
with shelves, drawer boxes on their runners, the hinge plates the side is drilled for
(drillSummary.side_hinge_holes_y, three per 770 door), the scene's leg (plate, stem,
foot from profile.hardware.leg at assemblies.legs.positions, one per x in elevation),
unit numbers on white in the clear band. Chains in their homes: the wall run above,
the floor run and the scribes below, the overall on the second line, front heights on
the right, bases, worktop and ceiling on the left.

